    "Input: queries = [[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 1.0]], corpus = [[0.9, 0.1], [0.1, 0.9], [-1.0, 0.0]], top_k = 2\n\nOutput: [[0, 1], [1, 0]]\n\nExplanation: Evaluated cv_clip_cosine_retrieval under standard test conditions."
